# IGDS — Cursor adapter

The binding rules are shared across all AI tools: @igds-registry/ai/IGDS-RULES.md

Generated catalogs (from the installed packages — do not edit by hand):
- Components: @igds-registry/ai/IGDS-COMPONENTS.md
- Tokens: @igds-registry/ai/IGDS-TOKENS.md

Summary (the rules file wins on any conflict):
- Use only official `igds-*` elements, their listed attributes/values/slots/events, and listed `--igds-*` tokens.
- Do not use `.gov-*` classes, `styles.css` or `design.md` as a source — legacy hand-made prototype.
- No official solution → write an `IGDS-GAP` report and stop; do not invent.
- Before finishing: `npm run igds:lint -- <path>` must pass.
